Meridiona/screenpipe-fork
==========================

This repository is a fork of mediar-ai/screenpipe
(https://github.com/mediar-ai/screenpipe) imported as a clean snapshot at
commit 892199f74 — the LAST commit published under the MIT License.

screenpipe relicensed from MIT to a Commercial license on 2026-06-10
(first commercial commit: 81e412ff5). The MIT grant on commits up to and
including 892199f74 is perpetual and irrevocable for those published
versions; this fork uses ONLY that MIT-licensed snapshot.

  * NO code at or after 81e412ff5 (the commercial relicense) is included.
  * The original MIT license is preserved verbatim in LICENSE.md.
  * The full upstream tree at 892199f74 is imported whole (not cherry-picked).
    The tree is verifiable against a fresh upstream checkout:
        git clone https://github.com/mediar-ai/screenpipe && \
          cd screenpipe && git checkout 892199f74
    and diffing against the import commit here.

Purpose: Meridiona forks this snapshot to run screen capture IN-PROCESS inside
the Meridian macOS app (linking the screenpipe-screen / screenpipe-a11y /
screenpipe-db crates as libraries). See the Meridian repo for usage.

Trademark: "Screenpipe" is a trademark of mediar-ai. This fork does not use
that mark in any distributed product; the repository name records provenance
only.
